{
  "description": "Storage detection cases for scripts/storage.py detect (framework doc 45 §2). Each case builds the environment it names in a temp directory and expects the storage mode for records and for the profile. Run by tests/test_apollo_product_lab_web_mode.py.",
  "cases": [
